WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:04,820
I'm a woman. There's nothing wrong with using weapons.

2
00:00:04,820 --> 00:00:07,660
It's up to you. Then I have nothing wrong with using weapons, right?

3
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:09,580
Don't worry, I don't have to force you

4
00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:13,040
When I used to watch TV series, I always wondered how powerful the fish was.

5
00:00:13,040 --> 00:00:14,920
Now I can finally verify it

6
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:17,780
Your surname is Gao

7
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:20,970
No, my last name is Lin.

8
00:00:20,970 --> 00:00:28,550
Where is this? When did you come behind me?

9
00:00:28,550 --> 00:00:40,340
The difference between level 11 and level 3 is so big

10
00:00:40,340 --> 00:00:48,140
Except for my brother, who was smashed and fractured

11
00:00:48,140 --> 00:00:49,610
My Lord Xigema

12
00:00:49,610 --> 00:00:51,730
He really doesn't show mercy to women.
